@* Marks the Suite's data set as self-contained sample data (#124).

   The Suite holds its own in-memory state and does not share it with a separately running
   EBICO.Server process (ADR-0009/ADR-0015). Without this note the seeded banks, subscribers and
   transactions would read like the live state of an emulator running alongside it. *@

